deactivated.description:
Deactivated deactivates (true) or reactivates (false) the user;
when present the other fields are not applied. An administrator
is not deactivated by a key.

status.description:
Issue-specific. Status, Priority, Type are always set on issue rows;
Pinned defaults to false in the column; Assignee is nullable so it
stays *string and is omitted when the issue has no assignee.
